        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "寝起きの髪がばさばさで、ブラシを通すのに苦労した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "手入れを怠ると、髪の毛はすぐにばさばさになってしまう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女の髪は、一日中外にいたせいで、ばさばさになっていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "dry",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "パンを焼く時間を間違えて、水分が飛んでばさばさになってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "冬になると、肌が乾燥してばさばさになるのが悩みだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "このクッキーは、口に入れるとばさばさした食感がある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "decisively",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
